
# --- GOLDEN TEST FIXTURE (2026-07-07) ---
# resetMode=loadvm: reset the guest between tests with QMP 'loadvm golden'
# (helper: golden-reset.sh). Fixture = single full-width TempleOS HolyC terminal
# at a clean 'T:/Home>' prompt (keyboard-reactive caret; mouse arrow tracks). No
# screensaver/DPMS/blank (none in TempleOS); AutoComplete/'God' demo window closed
# so only the built-in top HUD clock + input caret animate at idle. TempleOS is
# ISO/RAM-only, so a scratch IDE qcow2 (state.qcow2) holds the savevm 'golden'
# VM-state snapshot; launch runs WITHOUT -snapshot and auto -loadvm golden.
# Full manifest: tiles/templeos/golden.json + golden.env. savevm/loadvm verified.
SH_RESET_MODE=loadvm
SH_GOLDEN_SNAPSHOT=golden
SH_GOLDEN_STATE_DISK=/data/vms/streamhost/tiles/templeos/state.qcow2
SH_FIXTURE_DESC=clean-templeos-holyc-prompt
